# Routine "Read Aloud study session": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Checks every few minutes during a study session and reads each new course page aloud as the user moves through it.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/read-aloud && pi -p "/read-aloud-study-session"
